that request volume affects caching's realized benefit; C overcorrects into discarding
caching everywhere instead of recognizing it fits some workloads better than
others.)*

**Q5.10 — B.** Adaptive thinking's value is in letting the model assess reasoning need
per request, even within a category a human judged "simple" upfront — blanket
category-level disabling removes exactly that. *(A treats upfront human judgment as
always superior to per-request model assessment; C and D each invent a restriction or
unrelated mapping that doesn't reflect how the feature works.)*

### Domain 6

**Q6.1 — B.** Retrieving only what's relevant at the point of need uses context budget
