needed capability instead of scoping it properly.)*

**Q7.2 — B.** Distinct keys per environment prevent a development-time bug from
directly affecting production traffic, rate limits, and usage accounting. *(A
prioritizes simplicity over a demonstrated cross-environment risk; C understates a
real reliability impact, not just a cost-tracking inconvenience; D addresses
